            "review_title": "Review at Om Restaurant",
            "review_text": "John G\nCanada536 contributions\n0\nNot bad\nOct 2018 • Couples\nWe are not vegetarians but this was one of the few restaurants open in the area when we decided to head out on foot for dinner. The atmosphere is pleasant enough and the server was very sweet but not too knowledgeable about the menu.\n\nThe first two dishes we ordered (both pastas) we not available. We opted for the Singapore noodles and Hawaiian pizza. Neither was exceptional but they weren’t bad either.\n\nIt was a bit disorganized. Next time I would have ventured out by taxi and gone a bit further afield.\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2018",
