            "review_text": "Amandasjallsaints\nYorkshire, United Kingdom236 contributions\n0\nDelicious Food - Even if you are not a vegetarian\nMar 2018 • Couples\nHad two dinners at this restaurant and really enjoyed them both. The tempura mushrooms are fantastic as is the Sichuan Tofu. Every dish we had was excellent. Prices are very good and they also serve a decent white wine. Recommend even if you are not vegetarian\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 21, 2018",
