            "review_text": "Julia M\nYork, United Kingdom416 contributions\n0\nEven meat eaters should enjoy this place\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nOur choice of restaurants was restricted in district 2 but this was within walking distance of our hotel so we gave it a go. It is a lovely place with a huge menu, but in the end I settled for seaweed pate to start and braised Yuba for main. Both were excellent, and the portions were huge. I am a meat lover but didn't miss it at all this time. Give it a go.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 25, 2017",
