            "review_text": "Rosie T\n14 contributions\n0\nDelicious!\nOct 2016 • Family\nThis restaurant had wonderful food! I truly don't think that you could order wrong. We had about 6 dishes between the two of us. We did have to ask for no egg in our noodle dish, which makes me believe that this is not strictly vegan restaurant as the waiter wrote this down on his ordering pad. \n\nThe service was excellent - however I was asked at the end of the meal to write a review. I did not appreciate this but I am doing so because I had just told my husband how excellent the food was!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 14, 2016",
